<p>Dude this happens to me all the time, I have the craziest dream ever and then I forget about the whole thing after 10 minutes from waking up. I only remember one crazy dream I once had, and a horrible nightmare that I have almost every year that is the same nightmare. Some times I get dreams that seem like it lasted for a lifetime and then when I wake up I start feeling upset that it was fake, and I have to snap myself out of it and remind myself that my life is in reality. What I did with my nightmare is that I used it as an idea for an SCP that's still a concept waiting for review. You should definitely try basing an SCP off of a dream. You should see <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4621">SCP-4621</a> which is a very interesting SCP in my opinion and the creator based it off of one of his nightmares!</p>

